{"version":1,"content":"<p>流媒體音樂平台Tidal宣佈，自12月9日起，將拒絕並移除完全由人工智能生成的音樂作品，同時禁止發行商向平台提交此類曲目。不過，僅部分使用AI工具創作的音樂仍可繼續上傳。這一決定標誌着Tidal對AI生成內容的限制從「取消收益」升級為「全面下架」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/music/1587864.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:04:21.448426+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T18:54:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T18:57:33.625934+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T18:57:33.625934+00:00","content_hash":"492f1aabee15e8807207f50e9f3ee5f87d83966232962f4beee63742fb541544","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}